# The Debian packages of the testbox image, one row per package the Containerfile installs.
# Fields, separated by one space: <name> <version>
# The name is the Debian package name. The version is the exact one apt installs, which verifies the archive signatures.
#
# chromium: the newest version of the base's own suite, trixie with its security updates. Read at https://packages.debian.org/trixie/chromium
# and in the Packages index https://deb.debian.org/debian-security/dists/trixie-security/main/binary-amd64/Packages.xz. The trixie index itself
# still holds 150.0.7871.181-1~deb13u1. A security update replaces its predecessor in the archive, so the build stops at this row until it is bumped.
chromium 156.0.8078.79-1~deb13u1
# fonts-dejavu-core: the font fontconfig prefers for the families sans-serif, serif and monospace, and the first of the font alternatives that
# fontconfig-config, which chromium needs, names. Without it, a page that asks for system-ui got the letter widths of a monospace font. Read at
# https://packages.debian.org/trixie/fonts-dejavu-core and in the trixie Packages index
# https://deb.debian.org/debian/dists/trixie/main/binary-amd64/Packages.xz
fonts-dejavu-core 2.37-8
# fonts-liberation: the stand-in the fontconfig aliases pick for Arial, Helvetica, Times New Roman and Courier New, with the same letter widths,
# so a page that names those fonts breaks its lines where it does on a machine that has them. Read at
# https://packages.debian.org/trixie/fonts-liberation and in the same trixie Packages index
fonts-liberation 1:2.1.5-3
# locales: the locale sources of glibc, so the image compiles the locale en_US.UTF-8, which a test of a push gate uses to show that a list
# sorted by a person's locale is not in byte order. It depends on libc-bin at exactly its own version, so its version is the one of the base's
# libc-bin. Read at https://packages.debian.org/trixie/locales and in the trixie Packages index
# https://deb.debian.org/debian/dists/trixie/main/binary-amd64/Packages.xz
locales 2.41-12+deb13u4
# make: the build tool a job runs to compile C sources with the toolbox's emcc, such as a WebAssembly sandbox. Read at
# https://packages.debian.org/trixie/make and in the trixie Packages index https://deb.debian.org/debian/dists/trixie/main/binary-amd64/Packages.xz
make 4.4.1-2
# poppler-utils: the PDF tools pdftotext and pdftoppm, which the tests of PDF output run. Read at https://packages.debian.org/trixie/poppler-utils
# and in the Packages indexes of trixie, trixie-updates and trixie-security, of which only trixie holds this build; its dependency libpoppler147 is
# at the same version in the same index
poppler-utils 25.03.0-5+deb13u4
